      "calculation": "sequential vectorized removal of LOCK after ON then OFF at strict gap<50ms; assign OFF-derived post-filter row indices and fill UP then DOWN; group by episode_id; simultaneous group-local UNLOCK/ON state swap at strict gap<800ms; remove ON; retain consecutive UNLOCK/OFF rows; export first device and timestamps, last timestamp and source episode_id",
